name makeshape
category Package
revision 28973
shortdesc Declare new PGF shapes
relocated 1
longdesc The package simplifies production of custom shapes with correct
longdesc anchor borders, in PGF/TikZ; the only requirement is a PGF path
longdesc describing the anchor border. The package also provides macros
longdesc that help with the management of shape parameters, and the
longdesc definition of anchor points.
runfiles size=2
